    "Complex 2 exhibits a 2-fold interpenetrated 3D diamondoid network, with free Hisonic molecules occupying the channels/cavities.",
    "Three new MOFs, [Zn(atz)(nic)]n, [Zn(atz)(isonic)]n·nHisonic, and [Cd(atz)(isonic)]n, were synthesized using mixed pyridinecarboxylate/5-amino-tetrazolate ligands.",
